---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Gosub • Architectural Web Engine</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Marcellus&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style lang="scss">
      :root {
        --navy: #0B1021;
        --gold: #D4AF37;
        --cream: #FDFBF7;
        --gold-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #BF953F, #FCF6BA, #B38728, #FBF5B7, #AA771C);
        --font-serif: 'Marcellus', serif;
        --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      
      body {
        background-color: var(--navy);
        color: var(--cream);
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .frame {
        position: fixed;
        top: 20px; left: 20px; right: 20px; bottom: 20px;
        border: 2px solid transparent;
        border-image: var(--gold-grad) 1;
        z-index: 100;
        pointer-events: none;

        &::before, &::after {
          content: ''; position: absolute; width: 40px; height: 40px; border: 2px solid var(--gold);
        }
        &::before { top: -10px; left: -10px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }
        &::after { bottom: -10px; right: -10px; border-left: none; border-top: none; }
      }

      .deco-line {
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--gold-grad);
        width: 100%;
        margin: 2rem 0;
        position: relative;

        &::after {
          content: '❖'; color: var(--gold); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%;
          transform: translate(-50%, -50%); background: var(--navy); padding: 0 10px;
          font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
      }

      header {
        padding: 4rem;
        display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center;
        position: relative; z-index: 10;

        .logo {
          font-family: var(--font-serif);
          font-size: 3rem;
          color: transparent;
          background: var(--gold-grad);
          -webkit-background-clip: text;
          background-clip: text;
          letter-spacing: 10px;
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
          text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        nav a {
          font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 3px;
          color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;
          margin: 0 1.5rem; transition: 0.3s; padding-bottom: 5px;

          &:hover { color: var(--gold); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold); }
        }
      }

      main {
        padding: 2rem 10vw;
        max-width: 1400px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .hero {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 8vh 0;

        h1 {
          font-family: var(--font-serif);
          font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
          font-weight: 400;
          line-height: 1.2;
          color: var(--cream);
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
          
          em { color: var(--gold); font-style: normal; }
        }

        p {
          font-size: 1.1rem;
          font-weight: 300;
          max-width: 600px;
          margin: 0 auto;
          color: rgba(253, 251, 247, 0.8);
          letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
      }

      .pillars {
        display: flex;
        gap: 3rem;
        margin-top: 10rem;

        .pillar {
          flex: 1;
          text-align: center;
          padding: 3rem 2rem;
          border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
          position: relative;
          background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(11, 16, 33, 0), rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.05));
          transition: 0.5s;

          &::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: -1px; left: 10%; width: 80%; height: 2px;
            background: var(--gold-grad);
            transform: scaleX(0); transition: 0.5s;
          }

          &:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.8);

            &::before { transform: scaleX(1); }
          }

          .icon {
            font-size: 2rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
          }

          h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
          }

          p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            color: rgba(253, 251, 247, 0.7);
          }
        }
      }

      .status-block {
        margin: 10rem auto;
        border: 1px solid var(--gold);
        padding: 5rem;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 800px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1), transparent 70%);

        h2 {
          font-family: var(--font-serif);
          font-size: 2.5rem;
          color: var(--gold);
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
          letter-spacing: 4px;
        }

        p {
          font-size: 1rem;
          letter-spacing: 1px;
          line-height: 2;
        }

        .btn {
          display: inline-block; margin-top: 3rem;
          padding: 1rem 3rem; border: 1px solid var(--gold);
          color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none;
          font-family: var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase;
          font-size: 0.8rem; transition: 0.4s;
          position: relative; overflow: hidden;

          &::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: -100%; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: var(--gold-grad); z-index: -1; transition: 0.4s;
          }

          &:hover { color: var(--navy); &::before { left: 0; } }
        }
      }

    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="frame"></div>
    
    <header>
      <div class="logo">Gosub</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#vision">The Vision</a>
        <a href="#structure">Structure</a>
        <a href="#foundation">Foundation</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="deco-line"></div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>An elegantly structured <em>Modular Engine</em> for the open web.</h1>
        <p>Crafted in Rust with architectural precision. Swap the renderer, detach the layout system, construct your own experience.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="icon">✧</div>
          <h3>Modularity</h3>
          <p>Trait-based architecture allowing absolute freedom. Replace any component without the burden of forking massive legacy codebases.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="icon">✦</div>
          <h3>Performance</h3>
          <p>Powered by the safety and concurrency of Rust, delivering high-performance GPU-accelerated rendering through Vello.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="icon">✧</div>
          <h3>Independence</h3>
          <p>A pure, community-driven initiative free from corporate monoculture. Built for those who demand structural elegance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="status-block">
        <h2>Current Foundation</h2>
        <div class="deco-line"></div>
        <p>HTML5 parsing into valid DOM trees and CSS3 tokenization are currently operational. We are diligently constructing the layout engine and expanding the JavaScript runtime bridge. The architecture is sound.</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Examine the Code</a>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
